 and trail #278). `--keyword` is accepted for"," compatibility (it is the only mode); `--semantic` and `vsearch` return an"," error pointing here.","->>>>>>> origin/main"," "," Supply the query text positionally or with `--query`; flags can appear before or after it:"," "]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-retrieval/internal/cli/agent_setup.go","hunks":[{"oldStart":65,"oldLines":23,"newStart":65,"newLines":6,"lines":[" \t\t\t\t\t\"warning: %s is a git repository inside %s.\\nThe guide, AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md go to the inner one. If you meant the project, run:\\n    %s init-agents --repo %s\\n\\n\","," \t\t\t\t\troot, outer, setupCommandPrefix(os.LookupEnv), shellQuotedRepoDir(outer))"," \t\t\t}","-<<<<<<< HEAD","-\t\t\t// The pre-edit hook is the only PUSH path brain has; everything","-\t\t\t// else waits to be asked. A merge failure must not fail the whole","-\t\t\t// install -- the guide is the primary artifact and lands either","-\t\t\t// way -- but it must be SAID, because a hook silently not wired is","-\t\t\t// how this one sat unused since PR #24.","-\t\t\t// RESOLVE the prefix; do not hardcode it.","-\t\t\t//","-\t\t\t// `entire brain` is correct only when a host entire CLI is on PATH.","-\t\t\t// For a standalone install -- no ENTIRE_CLI_VERSION, which","-\t\t\t// setupCommandPrefix's own doc comment calls the common fallback --","-\t\t\t// the invocation is `entire-brain`, and a hook reading `entire","-\t\t\t// brain hook pre-edit` is a command that does not exist on that","-\t\t\t// user's PATH. It would fail on every edit, silently, which is the","-\t\t\t// same inert-hook failure the comment above is about.","-\t\t\thookChanged, hookErr := agentsetup.MergePreEditHook(root, setupCommandPrefix(os.LookupEnv))","-======="," \t\t\t// The PreToolUse merge is deliberately NOT inside agentsetup: that"," \t\t\t// package is mirrored byte-for-byte into entire-graph and its"," \t\t\t// documented write scope is exactly three instruction files. The"]},